@item Version 0.12.0, November 26, 2026
@itemize
@item
Every definition in the HTML reference can be opened to show the code
behind it: the chapter carries the top-level form the module's file writes,
and the page folds it into a @dfn{Source} panel of monospaced,
syntax-highlighted Scheme.  A reader without JavaScript reads the same code
as an example under the docstring.
